## Major Projects

### NEXA Consortium (May 2024)
- **Type**: Public-private partnership
- **Led by**: Staex
- **Partners**: Vantage Towers, paymenttools, Berlin Partner, Chirp Wireless, Lisk, ICP, Germandrones, The Drivery, Marienpark
- **Achievement**: World's first Web3-operated drone corridor in Berlin
- **Recognition**: Berlin State Deep Tech Award 2024
- **Inaugurated by**: Dr. Severin Fischer, German Secretary of State

### MINT Project
- **Partners**: MIBO (150-bus fleet), Solana, U2U, DIMO, IRIS
- **Focus**: Trusted telemetry for public transport
- **Features**: On-device signing, on-chain metadata (passenger count, CO2)

### PANTER Platform
- **Focus**: Real-time data capture for transport
- **Features**: M2M transactions, automated invoicing, auditing, certification

### Vehicle Tracking System (VTS)
- **Platform**: Internet Computer (ICP)
- **Features**: Trusted telemetry signing, on-chain contracts, automated invoicing
- **Status**: Proof of concept complete

### Linera Pilot
- **Scale**: 10 city buses in North Rhine-Westphalia
- **Capacity**: Up to 1 million transactions/day
- **Next phase**: 100+ buses production deployment

### Chirp Partnership
- **Scale**: Up to 200,000 municipal buses
- **Devices**: Up to 12 IoT sensors per vehicle
- **Data**: Air quality, temperature, humidity, movement patterns

